45cce24d-d8bc-4fcd-a4f4-de89e93a55ff	120923	\N	Keiko Kitagawa	keiko-kitagawa	Keiko Kitagawa (北川 景子 Kitagawa Keiko, born August 22, 1986) is a Japanese actress and former model. She was an exclusive model for the Japanese Seventeen magazine from late 2003 to mid-2006, and quit modeling when she left the magazine. Her first acting role was Sailor Mars in the Sailor Moon live action show Pretty Guardian Sailor Moon (2003-2004), and after her role in the film Mamiya Kyōdai, she left modeling to concentrate on acting. She has appeared in several films, including The Fast and the Furious: Tokyo Drift (2006) and Handsome Suit (2008), and has played leading roles in the TV Dramas Mop Girl (2007), Homeroom on the Beachside (2008), Buzzer Beat (2009), Lady Saigo no Hanzai Profile (2011),and Akumu-chan (2012).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Keiko Kitagawa, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.	https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbFxLjMvFnbdPA81RnJ5F9Pdi91.jpg	1986-08-22 00:00:00	\N	Kobe, Hyogo, Japan	UNKNOWN	4.6974	Acting	\N	\N	\N	t	2026-05-27 08:35:08.609	2026-05-27 08:35:08.609	\N
